--
-- Derived from OPM/opm-tests's composition/1D_COMP.DATA (same copyright and licence). The
-- derivation changes the geometry from five 1D cells to a 5 x 5 x 1 areal quarter five spot,
-- puts the producer at (5, 5, 1), and runs the wells on BHP limits instead of an injector
-- surface rate. The EOS data is ResSim's pinned ternary, which is OPM's ThreeComponentFluidSystem
-- with the precision the pinned specification records. See README.md beside this file.

------------------------------------------------------------------------
RUNSPEC
------------------------------------------------------------------------
TITLE
   QUARTER FIVE SPOT 2D

METRIC

TABDIMS
/
OIL
GAS
DIMENS
5 5 1
/

COMPS
3 /

WELLDIMS
2 2 1* 2 /

START
  1 'JAN' 2016 /

REGDIMS
1 1 0 0 /

UNIFIN
UNIFOUT

------------------------------------------------------------------------
GRID
------------------------------------------------------------------------
INIT

DXV
5*20
/
DYV
5*20
/
DZV
10
/

TOPS
25*2000
/

PERMX
25*100
/

PERMY
25*100
/

PERMZ
25*100
/

PORO
25*0.1
/

------------------------------------------------------------------------
EDIT
------------------------------------------------------------------------

------------------------------------------------------------------------
PROPS
------------------------------------------------------------------------

CNAMES
CO2
METHANE
DECANE
/

ROCK
68.9476
0
/

EOS
PR /

BIC
0
0
0
/

-- ResSim's pinned ternary: OPM's ThreeComponentFluidSystem, written at the precision the
-- specification records. Keep these in step with src/lib/ressim/src/fluid/pinned.rs.
ACF
0.224
0.011
0.488
/
PCRIT
73.8
46.0
21.0
/
TCRIT
304.1
190.6
617.7
/
MW
44.00
16.04
142.00
/
VCRIT
0.09412
0.09863
0.60980
/

SGOF
-- Sg    Krg    Kro    Pcgo
0.0000 0.0000 1.0000 0.0000
0.0500 0.0025 0.9025 0.0000
0.1000 0.0100 0.8100 0.0000
0.1500 0.0225 0.7225 0.0000
0.2000 0.0400 0.6400 0.0000
0.2500 0.0625 0.5625 0.0000
0.3000 0.0900 0.4900 0.0000
0.3500 0.1225 0.4225 0.0000
0.4000 0.1600 0.3600 0.0000
0.4500 0.2025 0.3025 0.0000
0.5000 0.2500 0.2500 0.0000
0.5500 0.3025 0.2025 0.0000
0.6000 0.3600 0.1600 0.0000
0.6500 0.4225 0.1225 0.0000
0.7000 0.4900 0.0900 0.0000
0.7500 0.5625 0.0625 0.0000
0.8000 0.6400 0.0400 0.0000
0.8500 0.7225 0.0225 0.0000
0.9000 0.8100 0.0100 0.0000
0.9500 0.9025 0.0025 0.0000
1.0000 1.0000 0.0000 0.0000
/

STCOND
15.0 1.0 /

------------------------------------------------------------------------
SOLUTION
------------------------------------------------------------------------

PRESSURE
25*75.
/
SGAS
25*1.
/
TEMPI
25*150
/
ZMF
25*0.1
25*0.3
25*0.6
/
RPTRST
BASIC=2
PRESSURE
SGAS
SOIL
PSAT
XMF
YMF
ZMF
DENO
DENG
VGAS
VOIL
/

------------------------------------------------------------------------
SUMMARY
------------------------------------------------------------------------

-- Only the vector the comparison uses, plus the field production totals kept for context.
-- `WBHP` and every block vector come back identically zero from flowexp_comp; they are not
-- requested here rather than carried as columns of zeros.
FGIT
FGPT
FOPT
FGIR
FGPR
FOPR
/

------------------------------------------------------------------------
SCHEDULE
------------------------------------------------------------------------

RPTRST
BASIC = 2
PRESSURE
SGAS
SOIL
PSAT
XMF
YMF
ZMF
DENO
DENG
VGAS
VOIL
/

-- One report interval before the wells exist. This is not a physical part of the case: with
-- no pre-well report step this build of flowexp_comp writes the *initial* restart state for
-- every report step while its summary advances, so the per-cell fixture would never move.
-- The interval is 0.001 d, and the comparison opens ResSim's wells at the same time.
TSTEP
    0.0010
/

WELSPECS
INJ FIELD 1 1 1* GAS /
PROD FIELD 5 5 1* GAS /
/
COMPDAT
INJ  1  1 1 1 OPEN 2* 0.0151 /
PROD 5 5 1 1 OPEN 2* 0.0151 /
/

-- 100 000 sm3/day with a 150 bar limit. The injector stays rate-limited throughout this case,
-- so the reference and ResSim are comparing the same prescribed moles; see README.md.
WCONINJE
INJ GAS OPEN BHP 100000 1* 150 /
/

WELLSTRE
ISTR 1.0 0.0 0.0 /
/

WINJGAS
INJ STREAM ISTR /
/

WCONPROD
PROD OPEN BHP 5* 50 /
/

TSTEP
    0.1000
    0.1000
    0.1000
    0.1000
    0.1000
    0.1000
    0.1000
    0.1000
    0.1000
    0.1000
/
END
